WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.469
-Well, guys the big news,
of course,

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.003
is that the president
and first lady

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:06.239
have tested positive
for coronavirus.

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:07.907
In any other time in history,

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:10.109
this would be the craziest story
of all time.

00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:12.412
In the year 2020, it's Friday.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:14.180
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.415
Seriously when the news broke,
2020 was like,

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:18.351
"Come on, you had to see
this one coming."

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:19.886
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:21.720
I actually didn't
see this coming.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.289
Last night, I went to bed
thinking tonight's

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:25.891
whole monologue would be about
NASA calling off their mission

00:00:25.891 --> 00:00:29.028
to send a $23 million toilet
to space.

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:30.530
[ Laughter ]
-What?

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.900
-We had 300 jokes on that.
-[ Groans ]

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.135
-Unlike the presidential debate,

00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:37.437
I hope people can learn
from this.

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:40.239
If the most powerful, most
protected person on Earth

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:42.508
can get COVID-19, anyone can.

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:45.444
And no one should have to suffer
through this horrible virus.

00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:47.313
But, yeah,
in the middle of night,

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:50.016
Trump confirmed the test results
by tweeting...

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.293
He tweeted that around 1:00 a.m.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.928
Usually,
that'd make people panic,

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:04.564
but for Trump, that actually
shows he's feeling normal.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.833
[ Light laughter ]
Once the news broke,

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:09.435
tons of well wishes poured in
from leaders around the country.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:11.604
Some Democrats even meant them.

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:15.175
[ Laughter ]
Joe Biden tweeted...

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.219
Trump was so touched.
He was like, "That's sweet.

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:27.754
Give him a like,
but not a retweet."

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.622
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.858
Of course, support for the
president and the first lady

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:33.893
is also coming in
from around the world.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:37.230
-Russia's Vladimir Putin
wished President Trump well

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.133
in a telegram according
to Russian state media.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.541
...the telegram reportedly said.

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:51.811
-Wait, a telegram?

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.913
[ Laughter ]
-Right?

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:56.249
-What happened? Was the
messenger pigeon in the shop?

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:57.851
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.851 --> 00:01:58.952
Putin was like
[ Russian accent ] Sorry,

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:01.087
is closest thing we have
to email.

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.622
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.324
[ Normal voice ]
It wasn't just a telegram.

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:06.793
Putin also sent Trump a get-well
Edible Arrangement.

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:08.661
Of course, in Russia,
Edible Arrangements

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:10.763
are filled with rocks
and expired beets.

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:13.032
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:15.067
All this information
came out last night,

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:16.302
but it wasn't the White House

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:17.903
that broke the news.
Listen to this.

00:02:17.903 --> 00:02:20.639
-It was not the White House that
informed the American public

00:02:20.639 --> 00:02:22.408
or informed us reporters

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:24.977
that Hope Hicks had reported
positive for this virus.

00:02:24.977 --> 00:02:28.280
It was Jen Jacobs, a reporter
at Bloomberg News.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.916
-Actually,
Bob Woodward also knew,

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:31.217
but he was saving the story

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.852
for his next book
in eight months.

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.420
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.322
When it comes to keeping
secrets, the White House

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:39.358
is worse than the "Big Brother"
house.

00:02:39.358 --> 00:02:42.227
Luckily, some people in Trump's
inner circle are okay.

00:02:42.227 --> 00:02:45.231
-Vice President Pence and
the Second Lady, Karen Pence,

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.866
have tested negative
this morning.

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:48.835
That's according
to their press secretary.

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:50.503
Obviously they were
quite concerned.

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:52.238
-That's right,
Mike Pence got tested.

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:54.607
For the nurse, it was like
sticking a cotton swab

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:56.142
up a giant cotton swab.

00:02:56.142 --> 00:03:00.946
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.946 --> 00:03:03.315
Yeah, it was a roller coaster
of a day for Pence.

00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:05.284
Here he is when he found out he
might have been exposed

00:03:05.284 --> 00:03:06.686
to the virus.

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:10.089
And here he is celebrating
that he is completely fine.

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:12.291
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:14.160
Meanwhile all this news is
leading to questions

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.895
about the next presidential
debate.

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:18.464
-Will the next presidential
debate even happen?

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:20.233
It is supposed to be in 13 days.

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:22.668
If you've tested positive
for COVID,

00:03:22.668 --> 00:03:24.904
you are supposed to isolate
at least 10 days

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:27.506
after the symptoms first appear.

00:03:27.506 --> 00:03:29.608
-Yep, the debate
could be postponed --

00:03:29.608 --> 00:03:30.976
not 'cause of the coronavirus,

00:03:30.976 --> 00:03:32.578
just 'cause no one
wants to moderate it.

00:03:32.578 --> 00:03:33.946
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.946 --> 00:03:35.682
Mitch McConnell
even floated the idea

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:37.483
of holding a virtual debate.

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:39.318
That should be good.
They couldn't stop interrupting

00:03:39.318 --> 00:03:41.888
each other in person, and now
they're gonna try it over Zoom?

00:03:41.888 --> 00:03:43.822
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.822 --> 00:03:45.758
Can we leave the meeting?

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:47.259
Let's change gears here.

00:03:47.259 --> 00:03:50.096
Today, I saw that a New York
staple is returning tomorrow

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:51.997
after a six-month absence...

00:03:51.997 --> 00:03:53.966
-Horse-drawn carriages
are returning to Central Park

00:03:53.966 --> 00:03:55.300
on Saturday.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.569 line:0%
Carriage drivers held a news
conference in the park.

00:03:57.569 --> 00:03:59.071 line:0%
Rides were halted in March

00:03:59.071 --> 00:04:01.240 line:0%
when nonessential businesses
were closed.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:04.310
-Good news is everyone agrees
that masks are good

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.012
when you are sitting
right behind a horse.

00:04:06.012 --> 00:04:08.080
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.316
New York is a lot different
than it was six months ago.

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:12.518
For 50 bucks, you can
hitch a ride around a park

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:14.519
or buy a two-bedroom apartment.

00:04:14.519 --> 00:04:16.189
[ Laughter, groaning ]

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:18.124
It's been a weird time
for the horses, too,

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:20.493
because the past six months,
they've been working over Zoom.

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:25.798
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:29.101
And finally, I saw that Brach's
is now selling candy corn

00:04:29.101 --> 00:04:31.303
that tastes like
Thanksgiving dinner

00:04:31.303 --> 00:04:34.406
with flavors like green bean,
turkey, and stuffing.

00:04:34.406 --> 00:04:35.775
[ People groaning ]

00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:37.677
Hey, don't knock it
until you spit it out.

00:04:37.677 --> 00:04:39.478
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.478 --> 00:04:41.313
If that was the vaccine for
coronavirus,

00:04:41.313 --> 00:04:44.317
people still wouldn't eat them.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:44.317 --> 00:04:46.753
At this point, 2020 is just
rubbing it in.

